{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106037","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106037/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106037/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106037/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106037","id":3036713787,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6UylQ3","number":106037,"title":"Add collision points to `PhysicsDirectSpaceState2/3D::intersect_shape()` results","user":{"login":"aterray","id":47152052,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTUyMDUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47152052?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray","html_url":"https://github.com/aterray","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","color":"b64245","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-05-02T19:41:04Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T08:53:14Z","closed_at":"2025-12-19T08:28:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106037","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106037.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106037.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Description\r\n\r\nThis PR enhances `PhysicsDirectSpaceState2/3D::intersect_shape()` with an optional `with_points` parameter.\r\nWhen enabled, each result dictionary will include:\r\n\r\n- `point_a`: Contact point on the queried shape\r\n- `point_b`: Contact point on the collided shape\r\n\r\nThis addresses [proposal #8667](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8667) which requested position/normal information in shape query results.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\n\r\nCurrently, there's no efficient way to get both collision points and object RIDs in a single call:\r\n\r\n- `collide_shape()`: Returns points without RIDs\r\n- `get_rest_info()`: Returns only the nearest collision\r\n- `intersect_shape()`: Returns RIDs without points\r\n\r\nThis enhancement eliminates the need for multiple physics calls when both position and object data are required.\r\n\r\n## Implementation Details\r\n\r\n```GDScript\r\nArray[Dictionary] intersect_shape(parameters: PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D, max_results: int = 32, with_points: bool = false)\r\nArray[Dictionary] intersect_shape(parameters: PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D, max_results: int = 32, with_points: bool = false)\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Default `with_points=false` maintains backward compatibility\r\n- Collision normal can be calculated as needed with `(point_b - point_a).normalized()`\r\n- The additional point calculations only occur when explicitly requested with `with_points=true`, ensuring no performance regression for existing code\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8667*","closed_by":{"login":"aterray","id":47152052,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTUyMDUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47152052?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray","html_url":"https://github.com/aterray","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aterray/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106037/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106037/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}